---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
// Fischer & Krauss (2018): LSTM on S&P 500 stocks, 1992-2015.
// Only facts from the abstract are drawn: no invented y-values.
const X0 = 60;
const X1 = 840;
const yr = (y: number) => X0 + ((y - 1992) / (2015 - 1992)) * (X1 - X0);
const split = yr(2010);
---
<figure class="p15g">
  <div class="scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 330" role="img" aria-label="Timeline from 1992 to 2015. Over the whole period the LSTM earned 0.46 percent a day with a Sharpe ratio of 5.8 before transaction costs. From 1992 to 2009 the outperformance is clear. From 2010 the profit fluctuates around zero after transaction costs.">
    <text x="20" y="26" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>An LSTM that worked, then did not pay</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Một LSTM từng ăn tiền, rồi hết ăn</tspan></text>
    <text x="20" y="48" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>Fischer and Krauss, S&amp;P 500 stocks, daily direction forecasts.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Fischer và Krauss, cổ phiếu S&amp;P 500, dự báo chiều giá theo ngày.</tspan></text>

    <rect x={X0} y="70" width={X1 - X0} height="44" rx="6" class="whole" />
    <DiagramIcon name="chart" x={X0 + 24} y="92" size="22" />
    <text x={X0 + 50} y="97" class="whole-t"><tspan data-lang-en>1992–2015, before costs: 0.46% a day, Sharpe 5.8</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>1992–2015, trước chi phí: 0,46% mỗi ngày, Sharpe 5,8</tspan></text>

    <rect x={X0} y="140" width={split - X0} height="76" rx="6" class="good" />
    <text x={X0 + 14} y="166" class="seg-t"><tspan data-lang-en>1992–2009</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>1992–2009</tspan></text>
    <text x={X0 + 14} y="188" class="seg-s"><tspan data-lang-en>outperformance is clear</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>vượt thị trường rõ rệt</tspan></text>

    <rect x={split} y="140" width={X1 - split} height="76" rx="6" class="bad" />
    <text x={split + 14} y="166" class="seg-t bad-t"><tspan data-lang-en>2010 on</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Từ 2010</tspan></text>
    <text x={split + 14} y="188" class="seg-s"><tspan data-lang-en>around zero</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>quanh mức 0</tspan></text>
    <text x={split + 14} y="206" class="seg-s"><tspan data-lang-en>after costs</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>sau chi phí</tspan></text>

    <line x1={X0} y1="240" x2={X1} y2="240" class="axis" />
    {[1992, 2000, 2010, 2015].map((y) => (
      <g>
        <line x1={yr(y)} y1="234" x2={yr(y)} y2="246" class="axis" />
        <text x={yr(y)} y="264" text-anchor="middle" class="tick">{y}</text>
      </g>
    ))}
    <text x="20" y="292" class="note"><tspan data-lang-en>The authors trace the profits to volatile stocks with a short-term reversal pattern,</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Các tác giả truy lợi nhuận về những cổ phiếu biến động mạnh có kiểu đảo chiều ngắn hạn,</tspan></text>
    <text x="20" y="312" class="note"><tspan data-lang-en>and say the excess returns seem to have been arbitraged away from 2010.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>và cho rằng phần lợi nhuận vượt trội dường như đã bị arbitrage mất từ 2010.</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Source: Fischer and Krauss, European Journal of Operational Research 270(2), 2018 (abstract). The 0.46% is a gross figure for the whole period, not a return you could have kept in the later years.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Nguồn: Fischer và Krauss, European Journal of Operational Research 270(2), 2018 (phần tóm tắt). Mức 0,46% là con số gộp cho cả giai đoạn, không phải lợi nhuận bạn giữ được ở những năm sau.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .p15g { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .p15g .scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .p15g svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .p15g text { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .p15g .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .p15g .sub, .p15g .tick, .p15g .note { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .p15g .whole { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .p15g .whole-t { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 14px; }
  .p15g .good { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .p15g .bad { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .p15g .seg-t { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 15px; }
  .p15g .seg-s { fill: var(--text); }
  .p15g .axis { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .p15g figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
